    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:26:30.430",
      "end": "00:26:31.580",
      "text": "In the executive summary,"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:26:31.580",
      "end": "00:26:33.550",
      "text": "it says that the removal of these buildings"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:26:33.550",
      "end": "00:26:36.810",
      "text": "will allow for other potential intermuses,"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:26:36.810",
      "end": "00:26:38.980",
      "text": "including farming of crops."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:26:38.980",
      "end": "00:26:41.160",
      "text": "And so I was just looking for a report back"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:26:41.160",
      "end": "00:26:47.610",
      "text": "to make sure we knew that that was realized or how much."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:26:47.610",
      "end": "00:26:48.380",
      "text": "Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:26:48.380",
      "end": "00:26:51.820",
      "text": "And two staff, I'm just curious if it is currently being,"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:26:51.820",
      "end": "00:26:53.000",
      "text": "if that land is being rented,"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:26:53.000",
      "end": "00:26:54.970",
      "text": "I would imagine unused agricultural land"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:26:54.970",
      "end": "00:26:56.340",
      "text": "with that would be our process,"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:26:56.340",
      "end": "00:26:59.430",
      "text": "but I will go to staff to answer."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:26:59.430",
      "end": "00:27:00.380",
      "text": "Yeah, through the chair, yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:27:00.380",
      "end": "00:27:03.430",
      "text": "We do actually tender up the land on an annual basis."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:27:03.430",
      "end": "00:27:04.780",
      "text": "So the lands are farmed."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:27:04.780",
      "end": "00:27:05.930",
      "text": "This was a portion of the land"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:27:05.930",
      "end": "00:27:09.670",
      "text": "that was used for livestock cattle."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:27:09.670",
      "end": "00:27:12.530",
      "text": "The farmer doesn't no longer wants to operate that business"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:27:12.530",
      "end": "00:27:14.790",
      "text": "and we don't see that these improvements"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:27:14.790",
      "end": "00:27:16.140",
      "text": "really have much value."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:27:16.140",
      "end": "00:27:18.320",
      "text": "And there's also a longer term studies"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:27:18.320",
      "end": "00:27:20.890",
      "text": "with respect to the lands and future projects as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:27:20.890",
      "end": "00:27:22.590",
      "text": "We'll be coming forward later in the spring"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:27:22.590",
      "end": "00:27:24.280",
      "text": "to council with some reports"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:27:24.280",
      "end": "00:27:29.320",
      "text": "to keep to get your decisions on those plans as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:27:29.320",
      "end": "00:27:30.740",
      "text": "Okay, thank you for that answer."
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:27:30.740",
      "end": "00:27:32.470",
      "text": "And with that in mind, Councillor Stevenson,"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:27:32.470",
      "end": "00:27:33.500",
      "text": "do you still want the motion"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:27:33.500",
      "end": "00:27:36.100",
      "text": "or are you happy for them to bring that report back?"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:27:36.100",
      "end": "00:27:36.930",
      "text": "Yeah, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:27:36.930",
      "end": "00:27:39.890",
      "text": "I would like just to see that and for the public too,"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:27:39.890",
      "end": "00:27:45.360",
      "text": "to just see what income is being generated from that."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:27:45.360",
      "end": "00:27:46.960",
      "text": "Okay, so would you like the report,"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:27:46.960",
      "end": "00:27:48.370",
      "text": "or your motion to reflect,"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:27:48.370",
      "end": "00:27:54.350",
      "text": "you would like to see the potential income streams then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:27:54.350",
      "end": "00:27:57.570",
      "text": "A report back on the income generated from that property,"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:27:57.570",
      "end": "00:28:11.530",
      "text": "the income opportunities from that property."
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:28:11.530",
      "end": "00:28:21.550",
      "text": "Are there any other speakers to that motion?"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:28:21.550",
      "end": "00:28:22.550",
      "text": "Can everyone see the motion?"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:28:22.550",
      "end": "00:28:24.660",
      "text": "Or has everyone had a chance to look at the motion?"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:28:24.660",
      "end": "00:28:28.570",
      "text": "Pretty straightforward, there are no other discussions."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:28:28.570",
      "end": "00:28:51.890",
      "text": "We will open that for a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:28:51.890",
      "end": "00:28:52.650",
      "text": "Councillor Hayne."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:28:52.650",
      "end": "00:28:59.180",
      "text": "Councillor interjecting."
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:28:59.180",
      "end": "00:29:00.240",
      "text": "Councillor interjecting."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:29:00.240",
      "end": "00:29:01.050",
      "text": "Thank you, just procedurally."
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:29:01.050",
      "end": "00:29:06.610",
      "text": "So we had the C added in, but it's not an amendment"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:29:06.610",
      "end": "00:29:09.280",
      "text": "to the original because we're in committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:29:09.280",
      "end": "00:29:29.840",
      "text": "Just checking."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:29:29.840",
      "end": "00:29:30.920",
      "text": "So this was what was put on the floor."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:29:30.920",
      "end": "00:29:31.970",
      "text": "So it's the first thing."
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:29:31.970",
      "end": "00:29:36.910",
      "text": "So it supersedes the original motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:29:36.910",
      "end": "00:29:42.460",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries, five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:29:42.460",
      "end": "00:29:44.350",
      "text": "Would anyone else like to put anything on the floor"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:29:44.350",
      "end": "00:29:49.630",
      "text": "with regards to this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:29:49.630",
      "end": "00:29:51.840",
      "text": "So can I, the only thing we have left"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:29:51.840",
      "end": "00:29:52.810",
      "text": "is confidential matters."
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:29:52.810",
      "end": "00:29:55.870",
      "text": "So I get a motion to move in confidential."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": "00:29:55.870",
      "end": "00:29:58.120",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor Stevenson, Councillor Cuddy."
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": "00:29:58.120",
      "end": "00:30:30.900",
      "text": "Okay, we'll open that for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": "00:30:30.900",
      "end": "00:31:56.560",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries, five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": "00:31:56.560",
      "end": "00:31:58.080",
      "text": "Okay, we're back in public session."
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": "00:31:58.080",
      "end": "00:32:01.840",
      "text": "Can I get Vice Chair Cuddy to report out?"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": "00:32:01.840",
      "end": "00:32:03.500",
      "text": "Thank you, Chair and through you."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": "00:32:03.500",
      "end": "00:32:09.930",
      "text": "We met in closed session from both 20 to 1230."
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": "00:32:09.930",
      "end": "00:32:13.070",
      "text": "We discussed matters and confidence"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": "00:32:13.070",
      "end": "00:32:15.200",
      "text": "and we made progress."
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": "00:32:15.200",
      "end": "00:32:17.060",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": "00:32:17.060",
      "end": "00:32:17.880",
      "text": "Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": "00:32:17.880",
      "end": "00:32:20.070",
      "text": "And last thing on our agenda is adjournment."
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": "00:32:20.070",
      "end": "00:32:21.460",
      "text": "Could I get a motion to adjourn?"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": "00:32:21.460",
      "end": "00:32:23.250",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": "00:32:23.250",
      "end": "00:32:25.050",
      "text": "Councillor van Merbergen, okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": "00:32:25.050",
      "end": "00:32:28.820",
      "text": "All those, oh, we just do it by hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": "00:32:28.820",
      "end": "00:32:32.910",
      "text": "All those in favor, okay, any opposed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": "00:32:32.910",
      "end": "00:32:34.120",
      "text": "Here we go, we're setting a good pace"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": "00:32:34.120",
      "end": "00:32:36.970",
      "text": "for the season, good job, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": "00:32:36.970",
      "end": "00:32:37.790",
      "text": "Motion carries."
    }
  ],
  "transcript_source": "lillian_skinner_archive",
